ch (in_progress, medium, assigned to Bob)\n\n---\n\n### 8. NETLIFY FUNCTIONS (Issues/Tasks related)\n\n**Location:** `/repo/apps/LinearClone/netlify/functions/`\n\n**Issue/task-related functions:**\n1. `issue-detail.ts` - Fetch issue detail\n2. `team-issues.ts` - Fetch team issues\n3. `my-issues.ts` - Fetch user's issues\n4. `create-issue.ts` - Create new issue\n5. `update-issue.ts` - Update issue properties\n6. `update-issue-status.ts` - Update issue status\n7. `bulk-update-issues.ts` - Bulk update multiple issues\n8. `search-issues.ts` - Search issues\n9. `cycle-issues.ts` - Fetch cycle issues\n10. `add-comment.ts` - Add comment to issue\n\n**Other functions:**\n- `login.ts`, `signup.ts`, `me.ts` - Authentication\n- `teams.ts`, `team-members.ts` - Team management\n- `projects.ts`, `project-detail.ts`, `update-project.ts`, `project-milestones.ts` - Project management\n- `cycles.ts` - Cycle management\n- `labels.ts` - Label management\n- `members.ts`, `team-members.ts` - Member management\n- `notifications.ts`, `notifications-count.ts` - Notifications\n- `workspace.ts` - Workspace settings\n- `db.ts` - Database connection\n\n---\n\n### 9. TESTING.MD SKILL FILE\n\n**Location:** `/repo/skills/tasks/build/testing.md`\n\nKey directives from the testing skill:\n\n**Main requirement:** Run all Playwright tests and get them to pass.\n\n**Test unpacking process:**\n1. List all test files in the app's `tests/` directory\n2. Add ALL test file tasks in a single `add-task` call\n3. One task per test file in alphabetical order\n\n**Requirements:**\n- All Playwright tests must pass\n- App must actually work (don't hard-code values)\n- Tests must correctly exercise the app per the tests.md spec\n- May fix bugs in tests if they don't match specifications\n\n**Replay.io integration:**\n- Must use Replay browser for Playwright test runs\n- Install: `npx replayio install`\n- Config must use `replayReporter` and `replayDevices['Replay Chromium']`\n- `RECORD_REPLAY_API_KEY` already set 